1. ud re-a nam ba-tar-ra-ba
#tr.en: In those remote days, when the fates were determined;
#lem: ud[sun]; re[that]; nam[fate]; tar[cut]
#etcsl: line-id=1

#etcsl#cite Cited in OB catalogue from Nibru, at Philadelphia, 0.2.01, line 7, line 20, line 21; OB catalogue in the Louvre, 0.2.02, line 7, line 14, line 15; OB catalogue from Urim (U2), 0.2.04, line 28; OB catalogue from Nibru (N3), 0.2.06, line 6; OB catalogue at Andrews University, 0.2.11, line 24

2. mu he₂-ŋal₂ an u₃-tud-da
#tr.en: in a year when @wDN{An} brought about abundance,
#lem: mu[year]; heŋal[plenty]; an[sky]; utud[give birth (to)]
#etcsl: line-id=2

3. uŋ₃-e u₂-šim-gin₇ ki in-dar-ra-ba
#tr.en: and people broke through the earth like green plants -- then the lord of the @fsux{abzu},
#lem: uŋ[people]; ušim[greenery]; ki[place]; dar[split]
#etcsl: line-id=3

4. en abzu lugal {d}en-ki-ke₄
#tr.en: King @wDN{Enki}, @wDN{Enki},
