#etcsl: line-id=5

6. e₂-a-ni kug {na₄}za-gin₃-na teš₂-bi ba-ni-in-du₃
#tr.en: built up his temple entirely from silver and lapis lazuli.
#lem: e[house]; kug[metal]; zagin[lapis lazuli]; teš[unity]; du[build]
#etcsl: line-id=6

